t":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a74ae8cc6fe515f14","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"claude/capabilities-matrix-impl-2a0cfd"}
{"parentUuid":"448a6fee-8a66-4c33-8bd6-ef85800eb506","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6b8557a2-9430-4f17-946a-1ea07dab5643","agentId":"a74ae8cc6fe515f14","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YX7xrZtmDUdChCqF23Eg1b","type":"tool_result","content":"commit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-142833/SEAL |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/events.jsonl           | 22 +++++++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/exit.txt               |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/payloads.jsonl         |  6 ++\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stderr.txt             |  1 +\n .../samples/20261003-142833/stream.jsonl           | 16 +++++\n ...8-34-01a1022a-acf2-7e12-9814-d1750d3ff095.jsonl | 28 +++++++++\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hook.sh |  5 ++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/hooks.json        | 24 ++++++++\n .../runs/shell-exit-status/setup/prompt.txt        |  1 +\n spec/capabilities/bash-tool-result.yaml            | 16 ++++-\n 14 files changed, 204 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)\nstatement: >-\n  The agent can ask to be woken after a delay with a prompt; a delay under a\n  minute or over an hour is clamped to those limits, and the request is\n  acknowledged with the time it is set for.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/scheduled-tasks#let-claude-choose-the-interval\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/schedule-wakeup-limits\n    deviations:\n      - adr: modeled-surface\n        statement: >-\n          The mock has no clock to wait on: a valid request is acknowledged and the\n          turn goes on at once, as the wake-up having fired, so the harness's\n          re-invocation when the wakeup fires or a task-notification arrives, and\n          the jitter the recorded wake-up times show beyond rounding up to a whole\n          minute, are not modeled. A self-paced /loop (a slash command, interactive\n          surface) is what Claude calls this tool for; no mock parses one.\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncapability-grounding\ncapability-once\nchild-processes\nfile-size\nlayering\nmock-config\nmodeled-surface\nmodules-cover-code\nstructured-files\ncodex-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\nexec.go\ninternal\nmain.go\nsnapshots\n\ncursor-mock:\nMakefile\ne2e\ninternal\nmain.go\nroot.go\nrun.go\nsnapshots\ncodex-mock/snapshots/runs:\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-exit-json\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhook-unstartable\nnested-session-env\nposttool-block\npretool-decisions\nprompt-blocked\nsession-end\nshell-exit-status\nstops\nsubprocess-session-env\n\ncursor-mock/snapshots/runs:\nadditional-context\nfile-tools\nhook-exit-codes\nhook-fail-closed\nhook-json-nonzero\nhook-matchers\nhook-timeout\nhooks-together\nnested-session-env\npretool-refusal\nsession-start-block\nshell-exit-status\nsubprocess-session-env\nsymlinked-cwd\ntool-failure","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9fdd8946-bc2e-49fe-a7cf-4692e8426a48","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:46:23.555Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"448a6fee-8a66-4c33-8bd6-ef85800eb506","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a74ae8cc6fe515f14","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286