{"parentUuid":"0b102a7e-d1dc-40b7-8a9f-39890dab0c6e","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a74ae8cc6fe515f14","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CffVxPZNro5JEANTDRzxo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both `schedule-wakeup` cells (codex and cursor) are now unsupported, with evidence from one new recorded run each. PR #93 is merged after all CI checks passed, and `sr-checks` came back clean after one fix.\n\n- **codex: unsupported.** Asked to schedule a wake-up without using the shell, it searched its tools for a wake-up tool, found none and made no scheduling call. It replied DONE. The cell cites `codex-mock/snapshots/runs/schedule-wakeup-ask`.\n- **cursor: unsupported.** Its wake-up timer tool (`subscribe_timer`) is for Cloud Agents only. The local agent searched for it, found nothing and said it has no such tool. The cell cites `cursor-mock/snapshots/runs/schedule-wakeup-ask`.\n\n**What changed:** each harness got one captured run of the same scenario, plus the two cells in `spec/capabilities/schedule-wakeup.yaml`. There is no mock adapter, marker or test, since neither harness supports the capability. The cells cite runs only; I froze no doc page, so cursor's Cloud-Agent-only claim rests on the run alone.\n\n**Judge refusal:** one `sr-checks` judge refused the first codex reason because it said \"no tool call at all\", while the transcript shows a search call. I reworded it to say it searched, found nothing and made no scheduling call.\n\nNothing is left red."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8190,"cache_read_input_tokens":66556,"output_tokens":477,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8190},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":477,"cache_read_input_tokens":66556,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8190,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":8190,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CffVxPHGHuvyMetpTPeUA","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"2f6dc654-3a96-43c6-8294-0fd18a1baee9","timestamp":"2026-10-03T14:57:46.578Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a74ae8cc6fe515f14","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
